d : @"debug"
<R> : <{ -> <int32>; tag <boolean> }>
<T> : <int32><boolean>
<U> : <int32><string>
show <null> : (n <int32>, choice <boolean><string>) {
    row <R> : (({
        d.print("function init {n}")
        -> n
        -> tag : true
        d.print("function tail {n}")
    }))
    copy : ((row))
    saved <R> : copy
    | choice <boolean> | {
        xs <T[4]><U[4]> : [1, row, ((saved)), choice]
        d.print("function list {n}")
        | xs <T[4]> | {
            first : xs[1]
            second : xs[2]
            third : xs[3]
            fourth : xs[4]
            | first <int32> | d.print(first~<int32>)
            | second <int32> | d.print(second~<int32>)
            | third <int32> | d.print(third~<int32>)
            | fourth <boolean> | d.print(fourth~<boolean>)
        }
    }
}
row <R> : (({
    d.print("entry init")
    -> 7
    -> tag : true
    d.print("entry tail")
}))
copy : ((row))
saved <R> : copy
choice <boolean><string> : true
| choice <boolean> | {
    xs <T[4]><U[4]> : [1, row, ((saved)), choice]
    d.print("entry list")
    | xs <T[4]> | {
        first : xs[1]
        second : xs[2]
        third : xs[3]
        fourth : xs[4]
        | first <int32> | d.print(first~<int32>)
        | second <int32> | d.print(second~<int32>)
        | third <int32> | d.print(third~<int32>)
        | fourth <boolean> | d.print(fourth~<boolean>)
    }
}
show(2, true)
show(3, false)
